# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Search engine ships with the role until a central ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` exists."
msgstr "**Despicate Elasticsearch:** Nave cu motor de căutare cu rol până la un centru ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` există."

# translated-by: libretranslate
