# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy."
msgstr "**SSO prin Keycloak:** Configurat automat la prima instalare."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); an `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adapted from [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n's own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2-proxy cu auto-preluare:** V1 toate porțile de acces prin comun Keycloak Client OIDC (oauth2- Margine proximă). openresty transmite identitatea autentificată către n8n ca o încredere `Remote-Email` antet (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); a `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adaptat de la [PavelSozonov/n8n-comunitate-so](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) citește că antet, auto-provizionează un local n8n utilizator la primul sign-in, și probleme n8cookie-ul de sesiune propriu n lui Keycloak utilizator aterizează direct în editorul flux de lucru, cu nici o secundă, n8Pasul n-local de conectare."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted ``Remote-Email`` header (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); an ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script (``files/hooks.js``, adapted from `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n’s own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2-proxy cu auto-preluare:** V1 toate porțile de acces prin comun Keycloak Client OIDC (oauth2- Margine proximă). openresty transmite identitatea autentificată către n8n ca o încredere ``Remote-Email`` antet (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); a ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script (``files/hooks.js``, adaptat de la `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) citește că antet, auto-provizionează un local n8n utilizator la primul sign-in, și probleme n8cookie-ul de sesiune propriu n Keycloak utilizator aterizează direct în editorul flux de lucru, cu nici o secundă, n8Pasul n-local de conectare."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** este SuiteCRMpropria SAML login împotriva Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` în [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), nu un proxy în fața ei. Cererile neautentice au lovit punctul de intrare al firewall-ului Symfony SAML, care redirecţionează către Keycloak; afirmația vine înapoi la `/saml/acs` și stabilește un real SuiteCRM sesiune, astfel încât aplicația redă propriul UI autentificat, inclusiv controlul de autentificare. Conturile sunt create la prima autentificare din afirmatie (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), iar certificatul de semnare IdP este citit de la KeycloakDescriptorul tărâmului prin [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) la boot, peste proxy Tor SOCKS ori de câte ori emitentul este o ceapă, pentru că o `.onion` emitent este nerezolvabil direct. `/auth` rămâne accesibil ca login-ul local de sticlă spartă."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** este SuiteCRM Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` în ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` rămâne accesibil ca login-ul local de sticlă spartă."

