# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Sonde pentru servicii încrucișate (biberon negat la prometheus, biberon negat la matomo, dashboard tile ajunge la) nu fac parte din per-rolul Biber persona. Ei trăiesc în propria specificaţie a furnizorului (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parametrizat o dată peste furnizorul `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. Pentru tabloul de bord, scenariul parametrizat îl deleagă `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, care deține vizibilitatea faianței / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" susţineri pop-out într-un singur SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Sondele transfrontaliere nu fac parte din persona de administrare per-rol. Dashboard Tile ajunge este deținut de `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, care deleagă organismul per-țintă `runDashboardCardScenario` Ajutor în `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile vizibile → faceți clic pe sarcini în `#main iframe` → antet \"Tab\" buton pop-uri înglobat într-o filă browser proaspăt). Acest ajutor este SPOT pentru mecanica bord-tile; specificatiile consumatorilor NU TREBUIE sa reimplementeze nici una dintre aceste afirmatii. Prometheus admin-reach și paritate de răzuire sunt deținute de `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach și prezența tracker sunt deținute de `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Fiecare furnizor parametrizeaza afirmatia asupra acesteia `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Afirmații de suprafață între servicii (dashboard tile accesibility, prometeus admin-reach and racle paritate, matomo admin-reach and tracker present, biberon-negated-at-prometheus, biberon-denied-at-matomo) sunt deţinute de specificaţiile furnizorului. Fiecare furnizor parametruază afirmația asupra acesteia `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, redat prin `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Personajul rolurilor consumatorilor NU TREBUIE să reproducă aceste sonde."

