msgstr "Acest rol Ansible instalează [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) client desktop pe sisteme Arch Linux folosind [AUR (Arc User Depozit)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
