# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Acest rol se desfăşoară **Shopware 6** cu **Docker**. Acesta automatizează instalarea, migrarea, și configurarea magazinului, integrarea cu un centru **MariaDB** Baza de date. Componente opționale similare **Redis** şi **OpenSearch** îmbunătățirea performanței și a capacităților de căutare, în timp ce **OIDC** integrează platforma administrativă cu **Keycloak**. Conturile directorului semnează în același mod: Shopware nu are extensie admin-LDAP acest rol poate instala, astfel încât identitatea LDAP ajunge prin KeycloakFederaţia de utilizatori mai degrabă decât printr-un plugin propriu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
